    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The Department of War News Feed includes a mix of military news from various sources, including discussions on NATO 3.0, increased European defense spending, and the naming of the newest Collaborative Combat Aircraft. The Navy awarded a contract for the MQ-25A Stingray, and the U.S. military is assessing the feasibility of restarting the production of the C-17 Globemaster III cargo plane. The Navy&#39;s USS St. Louis is deployed to support U.S. Northern Command&#39;s mission, and the SWRMC successfully undocked the USS America. The Department of War News Feed also covers the 2026 Armed Forces Golf Championship and the need for AI in combat. The Department of War News Feed includes updates on various military activities, from defense industrial cooperation to naval operations, aircraft production, and military competitions.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
